"P1079819794" "Crumpled note"
// DetailString :
"P1241432651" "The note reads:<br><br>'Another new hero has arrived on the scene. This {HeroName} could become a serious problem, and might disrupt the unloading of the latest artifact. We need to meet and discuss potential solutions.'<br><br>There is also a time and place on the note."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Relic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3369744831" "Clay statue"
// DetailString :
"P3212675643" "This small clay statue of a man is chipped in a dozen places. It looks as though it could easily be thousands of years old."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2264993844" "Myself and others here at the Modern Arcane Guild of Investigation have sensed a disturbing trend. The Hellions are making rapid headway in their bid to take over Atlas Park. These Hellions are thugs who have discovered some source of dark mystic powers, and use them to enforce a brutal reign of terror on the streets. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to take on the Hellions and show them they aren't welcome.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1852154642" "Take on the Hellions and show them they aren't welcome"
// SendOffString :
"P2684017007" "These Hellions are playing with powers they do not understand, and care little for who gets hurt. I would recommend you begin first by battling them on the streets of the city. Defeat 5 of their number to introduce yourself to them."

